diff --git a/com.unity.pipeline/CHANGELOG.md b/com.unity.pipeline/CHANGELOG.md
index 3820abc..4189c51 100644
--- a/com.unity.pipeline/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/com.unity.pipeline/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -5,6 +5,19 @@ All notable changes to this package will be documented in this file.
 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/)
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
+## [0.6.0-2022.1] - 2026-09-02
+
+Unity 2022.3 adaptation of upstream 0.6.0-exp.1 (rev `27af91a9`). See `package/ADAPTATION-2022.md`.
+
+### Changed
+- `unity: 2022.3`; semver prerelease `2022.1` so UPM will not overwrite this tree with registry `exp.1`.
+- PluginImporter metas for shipped CodeAnalysis DLLs: v3 → v2.
+- `Unity.Pipeline` asmdef drops `Unity.InputSystem` (commands stay `ENABLE_INPUT_SYSTEM`-guarded).
+
+### Added
+- 2022 `#else` shims: `PhysicMaterial` alias, `renderQueue`, `GraphicsSettings.renderPipelineAsset`.
+- Evolution layer retained from 0.5.3-2022.1: token-echo seam + `ArbitraryKeys`, prefab/scene confirm gates, `test_status` writes `running` on start, LZ4/LZ4HC/StrictMode build options.
+
 ## [0.6.0-exp.1] - 2026-08-31
 
 ### Fixed
